 354:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****         /* Determine the maximum priority from which ISR safe FreeRTOS API
 355:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****          * functions can be called.  ISR safe functions are those that end in
 356:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****          * "FromISR".  FreeRTOS maintains separate thread and ISR API functions to
 357:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****          * ensure interrupt entry is as fast and simple as possible.
 358:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****          *
