 399:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****              *
 400:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****              * This may cause some confusion in some cases - for example, if
 401:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****              * configMAX_SYSCALL_INTERRUPT_PRIORITY is set to 5, both 5 and 4
 402:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****              * priority interrupts will be masked in Critical Sections as those
 403:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****              * are at the same preemption priority. This may appear confusing as
