 405:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****              * configMAX_SYSCALL_INTERRUPT_PRIORITY and therefore, should not
 406:FreeRTOS/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****              * have been masked. Instead, if we set configMAX_SYSCALL_INTERRUPT_PRIORITY
